%% Real coding-agent workflow (sanitized).
%% Diamonds are GATES (decision points); red is a STOP (do not write code).
flowchart TD
    A[Task arrives:<br/>bug / feature / change] --> B[Orient:<br/>history-first AND status-first]
    B --> C{Inbound triage:<br/>is the symptom real on the<br/>output contract?}
    C -- "No (downstream)" --> C1[Push back with evidence.<br/>Do not write code.]
    C -- Yes --> P{Pre-existing<br/>or regression?}
    P -- "Pre-existing" --> P1[Prove it predates the change<br/>before assuming or rejecting]
    P1 --> D
    P -- "We caused it here" --> D[Investigate:<br/>cheap deterministic oracle first,<br/>root cause before patches]
    D --> E[Plan:<br/>options + trade-offs]
    E --> F{Is the human<br/>in agreement?}
    F -- "No / refine" --> E
    F -- Yes --> G[Implement: TDD<br/>RED -> GREEN, minimal change]
    G --> H[Verify:<br/>unit + scoped + regression suites]
    H --> I{Outbound gate:<br/>is the fixed output contract<br/>reproduced locally?}
    I -- No --> D
    I -- Yes --> J[Document:<br/>why + what + handover<br/>+ acceptance criteria + lessons]
    J --> S[Sanitise:<br/>scan the staged diff for<br/>names / IDs / agent attribution]
    S --> K[Handoff:<br/>the human does push / PR / deploy]
    K --> R{Automated review:<br/>valid findings?}
    R -- "Yes" --> G
    R -- "No / all addressed" --> L[Persist:<br/>update ledgers + lean memory,<br/>encode reusable lessons]
    L --> A

    classDef gate fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b8860b;
    classDef stop fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#a00;
    class C,F,I,P,R gate;
    class C1 stop;
